{"seq":1,"slug":"front-door-criterion","title":"前门准则：后门不可阻断时的替代识别策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/causal-inference/effect-decomposition/front-door-criterion","wordCount":2142,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"前门准则-后门不可阻断时的替代识别策略\">前门准则：后门不可阻断时的替代识别策略</h1><p>后门调整是观察数据下最常用的识别策略，但它有个苛刻前提：混淆变量必须全部可观测。现实中偏偏存在一类无法测量的混淆——基因倾向、企业文化、&quot;创始人的执念&quot;。当后门路径上站着一个看不见的混杂因素时，调整法束手无策。朱迪亚·珀尔（Judea Pearl）1995 年发表在《Biometrika》的论文《Causal Diagrams for Empirical Research》给出了惊人的答案：即使混淆不可观测，只要因果传导所经的中介结构足够干净，干预效应依然可以仅凭观察数据识别出来——这就是前门准则（front-door criterion）。它与工具变量并列，是&quot;后门救不了时&quot;的两条经典出路之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>前门准则的要素，下表先概览。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>一句话定义</th>\n<th>关键要求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>后门准则</td>\n<td>用可测混淆集封住 X 与 Y 的所有后门路径</td>\n<td>混淆全部可观测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>前门准则</td>\n<td>借助中介 M 绕开不可观测混淆</td>\n<td>M 覆盖全部因果通路</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>前门调整</td>\n<td>由三条件导出的两步估计公式</td>\n<td>M→Y 的后门都被 X 封死</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>前门准则是关于因果结构的断言，不是一种估计技巧。下文展开三条件、与后门的对照、公式推导与失效边界。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三条件与直觉\">三条件与直觉</h2><p>记 X 为处理，Y 为结果，M 为候选中介。珀尔给出的前门三条件是：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>全覆盖</strong>：M 介入了从 X 出发指向 Y 的所有有向路径——不存在绕过 M 的箭头 X→Y，因果只能&quot;走 M 这条独木桥&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>X→M 干净</strong>：从 X 到 M 不存在任何开放的后门路径，X 对 M 的作用如同被随机化。</li>\n<li><strong>M→Y 的后门全被 X 封死</strong>：所有从 M 指向 Y 方向的非因果路径都以 X 为共同节点，以 X 为条件即可切断。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>经典示例是珀尔在《Causality》（2009 年第二版）中反复使用的风格化吸烟问题：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    U[&quot;未观测混淆 U (如吸烟遗传倾向)&quot;] --&gt; X[&quot;处理 X (吸烟)&quot;]&#10;    U --&gt; Y[&quot;结果 Y (肺癌)&quot;]&#10;    X --&gt; M[&quot;中介 M (焦油沉积)&quot;]&#10;    M --&gt; Y\">flowchart LR\n    U[\"未观测混淆 U (如吸烟遗传倾向)\"] --&gt; X[\"处理 X (吸烟)\"]\n    U --&gt; Y[\"结果 Y (肺癌)\"]\n    X --&gt; M[\"中介 M (焦油沉积)\"]\n    M --&gt; Y</pre><p>直觉在于&quot;借道&quot;：U 同时污染 X 与 Y，我们看不到它，也就堵不住 X↔Y 的后门。但注意 U 到 Y 的信息要想&quot;冒充&quot;因果效应，必须伪装成经过 X 的样子；而 M 是 X 的下游且 X→M 之间没有 U 的干扰，于是 P(M|X) 是干净的因果量。剩下的问题是 M→Y 上还挂着 U——但这条可疑通路上必然站着 X（条件 3），而 X 是完全可观测的：我们可以显式地对 X 求平均，把 U 的影响&quot;积分掉&quot;。一句话总结：<strong>用可观测的中介链条，把不可观测的混淆圈进一个可以被条件化消解的结构里</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与后门调整的对照\">与后门调整的对照</h2><p>两种识别策略解决同一类问题（从观察数据得到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>o</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(Y\\mid do(X=x))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span>），但前提、成本与脆弱点截然不同：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>后门调整</th>\n<th>前门调整</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>适用前提</td>\n<td>全部混淆可观测</td>\n<td>存在满足三条件的中介 M</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>容忍未观测混淆</td>\n<td>不能</td>\n<td>能（限特定结构）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>必须观测的东西</td>\n<td>混淆集 Z 本身</td>\n<td>中介 M 与处理 X 的联合分布</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>估计复杂度</td>\n<td>一次加权平均/一层回归</td>\n<td>两步建模再加权（链路更长）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主要失效方式</td>\n<td>漏测任一混淆即偏</td>\n<td>三条件任一被破坏即偏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>假设可检验性</td>\n<td>不可检验，靠领域知识</td>\n<td>同样不可检验，且结构更精细</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型场景</td>\n<td>一般观察研究的默认选项</td>\n<td>混淆天生测不到、且有清晰传导链</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>权衡很清楚：前门准则换来的是对&quot;未观测混淆&quot;的免疫，付出的是对结构的极端敏感。后门准则漏掉一个混淆就完蛋；前门准则看似绕开了这一点，实则要求那条独木桥上不能有任何裂缝——工程实践中前者更常被满足，因为它只需要&quot;多测几个变量&quot;，而后者需要&quot;世界恰好长成那个样子&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"do-演算推导前门公式的思路\">do 演算推导前门公式的思路</h2><p>前门公式（对离散变量）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>o</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>m</mi></munder><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></munder><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>∣</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(y\\mid do(X=x))=\\sum_{m}P(m\\mid x)\\sum_{x&#x27;}P(x&#x27;)\\,P(y\\mid x&#x27;,m)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.9em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.25em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.344em;vertical-align:-1.294em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.856em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6828em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.786em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.294em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0519em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>它可以用 do 演算的三步&quot;图手术&quot;推出来，每一步都值得读懂：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>第一步，全概率展开</strong>：干预 X 之后，Y 的取值只能经由 M 发生（条件 1 保证没有旁路），故 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>o</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>m</mi></msub><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>o</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>o</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(y\\mid do(x))=\\sum_m P(m\\mid do(x))\\,P(y\\mid do(x),m)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0017em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li><strong>第二步，摘掉第一个 do</strong>：由于 X→M 之间没有后门（条件 2），对 X 的干预不影响 M 的分布形态之外的东西，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>o</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(m\\mid do(x))=P(m\\mid x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>——这正是观察数据可以直接估计的部分。</li>\n<li><strong>第三步，摘掉第二个 do</strong>：在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 时，Y 仍依赖不可观测的 U；但条件 3 保证以 X 为条件能切断 M 与 U 的联系，于是可以把&quot;干预 X=x&quot;换成&quot;对 X 的观察分布求平均&quot;：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></msub><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>∣</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_{x&#x27;}P(x&#x27;)P(y\\mid x&#x27;,m)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0516em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1783em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6828em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.786em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0019em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。这一步最精妙——用 X 的边缘分布把看不见的 U 彻底积掉。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>完整证明见 Pearl（1995，《Biometrika》）及《Causality》第 3 章；这也是 do 演算&quot;能把 do 逐步改写成观察概率&quot;这一识别能力的第一个著名战果。落到估计上，前门调整只是两个回归加一次加权平均：先拟合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>M</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(M\\mid X)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，再拟合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>X</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(Y\\mid X,M)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，最后按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(X)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 混合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"什么时候连前门也救不了\">什么时候连前门也救不了</h2><p>前门准则的条件是关于真实数据生成机制的断言，数据本身无法验证。以下情形会让它失效，实践中逐一排查：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>存在旁路</strong>：X 对 Y 还有不经过 M 的直接影响（药物的安慰剂渠道、政策的信息效应），条件 1 破坏——此时&quot;经 M 的部分&quot;不再是全部因果。</li>\n<li><strong>X→M 自己有后门</strong>：例如医生更愿意给重症患者用药，而病情也影响用药依从性，条件 2 破坏，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>M</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(M\\mid X)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 从根上就不干净。</li>\n<li><strong>M→Y 有绕过 X 的后门</strong>：某个共同原因（如整体健康状况）同时影响焦油代谢与癌变、且不经过 X，条件 3 破坏，第三步的&quot;积分消元&quot;无从谈起。</li>\n<li><strong>数据层面</strong>：M 存在测量误差；某些 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x&#x27;,m)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0019em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 组合没有样本支撑，高维求和方差爆炸；中介本身是多维潜变量却被当成标量。</li>\n<li><strong>更根本地</strong>：如果因果图里根本不存在满足三条件的 M，任何观察性识别都已出局——剩下的选项只有工具变量（第四章）或补做实验。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>最大的反模式是把&quot;随便找个中介塞进公式&quot;当成识别成功：三条件是对世界的建模承诺，画错一条边，公式照样输出一个貌似合理的数字。工程侧可用基于图的识别器自动核查——微软 DoWhy（PyWhy 生态，PyPI 包 dowhy）的自动识别模块即包含前门识别路径；结构简单的场合手写上面两步公式也不过十几行代码。真正难的从来不是计算，而是为那张图辩护。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>后门调整要求混淆全部可观测；前门准则在其失效时借中介 M 识别因果，是因果图框架的标志性成果（Pearl, 1995, Biometrika）。</li>\n<li>三条件：M 覆盖 X→Y 的全部有向路径；X→M 无开放后门；M→Y 的后门全部被 X 封死。</li>\n<li>前门公式是两步估计：先学 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>M</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(M\\mid X)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，再学 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>X</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(Y\\mid X,M)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(X)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 混合——用可观测链条围剿不可观测混淆。</li>\n<li>对照后门：前门换取了对未观测混淆的免疫，代价是结构敏感、估计链路翻倍、假设依旧不可检验。</li>\n<li>连前门也救不了的信号：存在旁路、X→M 或 M→Y 有自己的后门、中介测量误差、或这样的 M 压根不存在。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"相关篇目\">相关篇目</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"../causal-graphs/backdoor-and-ladder\">后门准则与因果阶梯</a>：本篇的对照基线——后门何时失效。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../methods/iv-and-natural-experiments\">工具变量与自然实验</a>：对付不可观测混淆的另一条经典出路。</li>\n<li><a href=\"mediation-analysis\">中介分析：把总效应分解为直接与间接</a>：同一中介结构的另一种用法——机制归因而非识别。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"前门准则：后门不可阻断时的替代识别策略","id":"前门准则-后门不可阻断时的替代识别策略"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"三条件与直觉","id":"三条件与直觉"},{"level":2,"text":"与后门调整的对照","id":"与后门调整的对照"},{"level":2,"text":"do 演算推导前门公式的思路","id":"do-演算推导前门公式的思路"},{"level":2,"text":"什么时候连前门也救不了","id":"什么时候连前门也救不了"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"相关篇目","id":"相关篇目"}],"prev":{"title":"因果视角对 AI 的根本价值与意义","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/causal-inference/causal-ml/value-for-ai-significance"},"next":{"title":"中介分析：把总效应分解为直接与间接","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/causal-inference/effect-decomposition/mediation-analysis"}}